Phase 2
Resident submits complaint
14. Resident opens new complaint page to submit a complaint. 
15. Resident adds title, description, incident, location, and additional landmarks if needed. 
16. Resident may or may not add photo evidence. This is optional. 
Categorisation 
17. System analyses the title description and assigned the most suitable category.
18. If the user desires, the user can choose a category themselves
19. User chooses a category from the drop-down menu.
Final submit 
20. User free clicks confirm submission button and prompt arrives. 
21. Complain submitted to admin portal for review.